{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'if test -f frontier_brief.md; then cat frontier_brief.md; fi'","aggregated_output":"# Unverified frontier brief: bp35 level 7\n\nThis is a compact index of the latest clean WIP, not solver evidence.\nReproduce every observation you rely on with the documented local API.\nDo not reread the full proposer transcript unless a named ambiguity requires it.\n\n## Verified parent budget\n\n- Exact parent boundary: level 6 at 180 actions.\n- Remaining real-action budget under the harness cap: 420 of 600.\n- This budget is verifier evidence. If it is insufficient, optimize earlier composed legs rather than searching an uncommittable suffix.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
